_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-03T17:47:26Z","updated_at":"2024-12-03T17:47:26Z","body":"Would be nice to see how it compares to old ` | 32 ` trick like in the if for toLower to have `return ((ch >= 'A' && ch <= 'Z') || (ch >= 192 && ch <= 222)) ? (ch | 32) : ch` and for toUpper `return ((ch > 'a' && ch < 'z') || (ch > 224)) ? (ch & (~32)) : ch` \r\nIt might not be faster than a look up table but it would be interesting to see how it compares","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2515219204/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2515233935","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99971#issuecomment-2515233935","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99971","id":2515233935,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6V62yP","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-1